9", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499314641_2334058800454382_6810420958056556067_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cFD6Dn_CXwMQ7kNvwH1AfA6&_nc_oc=AdohhqSJFWrWODNpBYk9zFX_fgUTFk96r0SU4lcCxn8_MwVP0CFOvMtcJBE7e2lvUfo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLDpiLS5Fv2QuoS3zfeyBjC5oSm2dzKQHh0ncQ3e4lO7g&oe=6AB7C9DB"}, {"file_name": "com.onenightcircus.fields-20251218-203353.png", "id": "1290753326156435", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312236_1290753329489768_4332884711738293422_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dvzIUdBbHMYQ7kNvwHV-JQK&_nc_oc=AdoWs22YHmM9VNp5RS3EJIm_bSOpo93ca7d--WR26i6HUPFGIy3BeoBni9UVZIK_vmo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQL47uQbwHmcYXHx5j1m0tjoRB-3D9uSFHraaicUZ1MSmw&oe=6AB7C981"}, {"file_name": "com.onenightcircus.fields-20251218-203201.png", "id": "1926405484733596", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312338_1926405491400262_5342535590335345652_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WNQN9PrerC8Q7kNvwEEsAW7&_nc_oc=Ado_-l5_Ss5iZ7q9Yg8p1h-LnQE9UsL6q5iUV5W-tCB3etBTcWkgFMN7Ng7z-SLWbMM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLUX4x9Mz0k-sI0Jw7_tRaoKgJFT17mMbLRiKptDPH2zw&oe=6AB7ED9D"}, {"file_name": "com.onenightcircus.fields-20251218-203301.png", "id": "974613512240519", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312470_974613515573852_1573452143751525995_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XZoVSURkn1sQ7kNvwECJlP8&_nc_oc=AdprzGN0kViJMNkEscEDDTrJ_j43C0zWXQb_96gjbBsQNKp7_QewTaTsGV88LwT5q3Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIn3UNzd0TwAZFkfyyGnAO4MNjHb6gwJY-iQ7mGAb4l0g&oe=6AB7B73F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "fields-artwork-v2-2560x1440.png", "id": "1690141432030718", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499311597_1690141435364051_2132099073325899983_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_oKIyX-4Pk4Q7kNvwFO1Ahe&_nc_oc=AdrKJpduk3HyxuiOBt21UropvnkK0VeuFKECZvQVIVv5CK7XDtEXRnGVxHkbsimc-KI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIy5dbuVGplACYuybTQavaF9Qr3Eywj22bJU0K_OXiSGA&oe=6AB7E3EE"}, "display_name": "Fields", "keywords": ["music", "inmersive", "art", "visuals", "meditation"], "long_description": "Fields is not an album you listen to. It is a place you enter.\n\nAn immersive VR experience built around the music of electronic producer Die Stadt, Fields dissolves the boundary between sound and space. Each track becomes an environment: shifting fields of light, generative textures, and slow chromatic movements that respond to the music in real time.\n\nFields is designed for deep listening \u2014 a rare kind of attention that VR makes possible. No narrative, no objectives. Only presence.\nWhat you will find inside:\n\n- A full-length electronic music album experienced as a living, breathing space.\n- Generative visuals that evolve with the music.\n- Designed for extended, contemplative sessions.\n- Optimized for Meta Quest 3.\n\nFields is an album. Fields is a place. Now you can enter both.\n\nStep in.\n{1548057873348580}", "short_description": "Step inside the music of electronic/ambient producer Die Stadt. Sound becomes space. Space becomes music."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "uba_APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE.png", "id": "2273186383217800", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307451_2273186386551133_8686410893456982869_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=aZ-dFVEW4qUQ7kNvwHNNDOS&_nc_oc=AdrPzWxtkoa7yUud-maV-ByLqIRZf9kIGxGbyH89ALx09C-lntF_KVnhrg5iX-RvOuo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLgFR-fojlu_gmYeakfCNfL_oDJL3SP83YXNiunZd6jcQ&oe=6AB7DCDF"}, {"file_name": "fields_logotipo_512x512.png", "id": "2080711572861858", "image_type": "APP_IMG_L